Z||000000||Smoooooth GT||06-16-2001||06:55 PM||||I'm getting people even e~mail me asking me to leave my front fascia alone as far as the headlight's are concerned. A few have said for me to use 90's Cutlass light's, 300Z light's mounted in factory place.... <BR>Please vote here::::::<BR>1. for Factory light's to be left alone. add blue, hyper, gold, etc.<P>2. for adding a different light INTO the fascia. Anything into the fascia would be a number 2 vote.<P>Thank's for all opinion's.. As I said before, This "Smoooth GT Project" Is going to be done with Idea's from this Forum.(THE BEST FIERO PEOPLE IN THE WORLD).<BR>                           Steve<BR>                           <P>------------------<BR>Future add's.. 2" drop, 17" wheel's, finish the turbo T-3watercooled project, ViperYellow w/blk racin' stripes.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/new_sig_2.JPG"> ||||reg||6
Z||000001||Urchin||06-16-2001||07:31 PM||||Personally I'm not one for head light mods, so I would vote to leave them alone (#1 option)  And if you're going to do the coloured ions, I would probably go with the gold because it will match the yellow best.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature2_3.jpg">   <P>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cheever2||06-16-2001||07:39 PM||||I vote #2.  The Sunfire lights in your other thread were the first I've seen.  The only 300ZX lights I've seen on a Fiero are those on the $175000 "Chameleon", and they look good too.<P>Bottom line is I like variety, and I respect people with the guts to try something different.  So, #2.<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000003||BAM-BAM||06-16-2001||07:39 PM||||  I'm with URCHIN,, leave them aloan and add the Hyper white, blue, whatever. Or, you could go with Cadavers flush mounts  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
